{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にライブでお休みした時に\nアシスタントの代理もしてくださった\n西 恵利香さんが来てくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵利香ちゃん\nお会いしてさらに好きになりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい匂いでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達になれるように\n少しずつ密かに近づいていきたいから\nまた来ていただきたいなと思いました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はいろんなマンガを\nリスナー様に教えて頂いたわけですが\nスポーツを観よう\nという気持ちになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝、早速\n新体操を観ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンガも次までに何かしら\n読みたいと思っております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次までに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...そうなんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は\nアンダーライブで中国地方に行ってる故に\n中田は出られないんですが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ言えないけど誰かが代打を務めてくれるので\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に飯ぺろです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白一"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒蜜抹茶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒蜜や小豆が入ってて甘さはあるけど\nアイスがスッキリしてて食べやすい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスだけど\nヘルシーな印象！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白玉やパンプキンシードも入ってるから\nいろんな食感が楽しめます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんのブログにも載ってましたが\n舞台観た後に\n一緒に食べてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから\nこち亀 行く方は是非。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとあまりにも写メを撮ってないことに\n気づきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、メイクしてなかったってのもあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/17/9412422/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ載せてない写メが\n全国ツアーの時の\nこんなんしかありませんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ安定の\n中田へ意地悪してる時のいい笑顔の琴子さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ショット撮らしてくれない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも\n琴子さんが好きなんですけどねぺろぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}